sequenceDiagram
  participant Runtime
  participant Workflow as Recovery workflow
  participant Repository as StateRepository
  participant Broker as CEX-neutral broker ports
  participant Domain as Domain invariants

  Runtime->>Workflow: Restart / reconnect / stream gap / unknown mutation
  Workflow->>Domain: Set market to RECONCILING; block order mutations
  Workflow->>Repository: Load durable snapshot if available
  Workflow->>Broker: Fetch balances, open orders, order history, fills and rules
  Broker-->>Workflow: Canonical facts + completeness metadata
  Workflow->>Domain: Validate identity, fees, reservations and inventory ownership
  Workflow->>Domain: Replay missing fills idempotently
  Domain-->>Workflow: Consistent / incomplete / mismatch
  alt All required evidence complete
    Workflow->>Repository: Persist reconciled checkpoint
    Workflow-->>Runtime: READY or ACTIVE from reconstructed state
  else Unknown or inconsistent evidence
    Workflow-->>Runtime: PAUSED_UNSAFE; actionable reason; no order mutations
  end